        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process"
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit process start and explicit initial action step align directly with the opening clause."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to the first message transmission step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the sequential delivery of the design document."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4_f"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact correspondence to the faculty selection step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully combines the identification and publisher contact actions into one step as described."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "guard:b1->n6",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "The full conditional clause supports the condition action, the XOR branch, the positive guard, and the resulting notification action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n7",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the alternative branch path and the subsequent cost calculation step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to the margin addition and retail price determination."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12",
        "guard:b2->n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Describes the reconsideration action, the continuation/convergence of the flow, and maps to the alternative branch guard."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "guard:b2->n10",
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the second branch condition, the positive guard, and the comprehensive bookstore notification containing all listed details."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "The final notification step and explicit process termination match the closing sentence."
    }
  ],
